## Title: Companion Exporter (private test build)
## Description: Shows your own character data (research, known traits/recipes/motifs, bags, bank, craft bag, house chests) as QR codes for the Companion phone app. Only when you press Export (Settings > Add-Ons) or run /export. No automation, no network.
